Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:06.70,English,,0,0,0,,So I'm in Scotland, right? And I'm like, I gotta see this Loch Ness thing!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.50,0:00:06.70,Portuguese,,0,0,0,,Então eu estou na Escócia, certo? E eu pensei: preciso ver esse negócio do Lago Ness!

Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:15.40,English,,0,0,0,,The locals kept saying 'Aye, ye cannae miss it, laddie!' I'm like... what?!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.00,0:00:15.40,Portuguese,,0,0,0,,Os locais ficavam dizendo 'Aye, ye cannae miss it, laddie!' E eu tipo... o quê?!

Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:21.20,English,,0,0,0,,That night, I couldn't sleep. I kept thinking about Nessie. What if she's real?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.70,0:00:21.20,Portuguese,,0,0,0,,Naquela noite, eu não conseguia dormir. Ficava pensando na Nessie. E se ela for real?

Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:27.70,English,,0,0,0,,And then I had this crazy dream! Nessie showed up wearing a Yankees cap!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.50,0:00:27.70,Portuguese,,0,0,0,,E então eu tive esse sonho maluco! A Nessie apareceu usando um boné dos Yankees!

Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:34.70,English,,0,0,0,,I woke up freaking out! In New York, the scariest thing is the subway at 3 AM!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.00,0:00:34.70,Portuguese,,0,0,0,,Eu acordei surtando! Em Nova York, a coisa mais assustadora é o metrô às 3 da manhã!

Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:42.00,English,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I never saw Nessie for real. But I got a sick selfie with the lake!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.00,0:00:42.00,Portuguese,,0,0,0,,Enfim, eu nunca vi a Nessie de verdade. Mas tirei uma selfie incrível com o lago!

Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:48.30,English,,0,0,0,,Oh, and pro tip: if a Scottish person says 'It's a wee bit cold', bring a winter coat!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.30,0:00:48.30,Portuguese,,0,0,0,,Ah, e dica: se um escocês diz 'It's a wee bit cold', leve um casaco de inverno!
